# Build output
/je
/dist/
web/node_modules

# NOT ignored: internal/webui/dist. The built client is committed on purpose --
# it is what lets `go build ./cmd/je` produce a working binary on a machine with
# no npm, and what keeps the image a single static build (D23). Regenerate it
# with `make web-build`.

# The secret store, in case JE_DATA_DIR is ever pointed at the repo.
secrets.json

# A local data directory, if someone points JE_DATA_DIR here while developing.
# The real one lives in ~/.je and contains the secret store (D10).
/data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
